OL,3,A'Not far enough' - US parents and teens
OL,4,Aon Meta's new limits for young users
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis week, Meta announced new
OL,7,Frestrictions on its platforms - which
OL,8,Finclude Instagram, Facebook and
OL,9,FWhatsapp - as part of an $18bn
OL,10,F(#13.25bn) settlement with US states in
OL,11,Fa lawsuit on social media's effects on
OL,12,Fchildren.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
